{
  "title": "Review the Fax Review Queue",
  "source": "modules/referral-intake/fax-queue-review",
  "url": "https://help.medipyxis.com/modules/referral-intake/fax-queue-review/",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-01",
      "claim": "Open it from the Fax Review Queue item in the sidebar, or click Fax Queue on the Patient Intake board header. It is not a kanban column.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "label: \"Fax Review Queue\"", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "`/facility/${targetFacility}/fax-review-queue`", "paths": ["frontend/src/pages/Referrals.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ],
      "finding": "No Fax Review Queue item in the live sidebar (frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx:629-756). It is reached from the board's Fax Queue button (Referrals.tsx:3313), the Fax Review Queue tile under Fax Center (MorePage.tsx:134; AppShell.tsx:751) or ⌘K \"Fax review queue\" (AppShell.tsx:815).",
      "proposed_text": "Open it with Fax Queue on the Patient Intake board header, from the Fax Review Queue tile under Fax Center in the sidebar, or with ⌘K \"fax review queue\". It is not a kanban column.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "`/facility/${targetFacility}/fax-review-queue`", "paths": ["frontend/src/pages/Referrals.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "label: \"Fax Center\",", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "title: \"Fax Review Queue\",", "paths": ["frontend/src/pages/MorePage.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "title: \"Fax review queue\",", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/AppShell.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-02",
      "claim": "Columns: Received, Patient Info, File Name, Document Type, Priority, Status, Confidence, SLA, Actions.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "<TableHead( className=\"text-right\")?>(Received|Patient Info|File Name|Document Type|Priority|Status|Confidence|SLA|Actions)</TableHead>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": { "count": 9 } },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "const FaxReviewQueue = lazy(() => import(\"./components/idp/FaxReviewQueue\"));", "paths": ["frontend/src/user-routes.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-03",
      "claim": "Patient Info shows what was extracted about the patient, when available.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "item.extraction_result?.extracted_data", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-04",
      "claim": "Document Type shows the classified document type.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "{item.fax?.subject || \"Fax Document\"}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "absent" }
      ],
      "finding": "The Document Type cell shows the fax's subject line, or \"Fax Document\" when there is none (frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx:695). It does not show a classified document type.",
      "proposed_text": "Document Type: the fax's subject line, or \"Fax Document\" when the fax has no subject.",
      "proposed_checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "{item.fax?.subject || \"Fax Document\"}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-05",
      "claim": "Priority: STAT, Emergent, Urgent, or Routine (a filter on this queue); the Add New Patient form uses Routine, Urgent, or Emergent and does not include STAT.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"(stat|emergent|urgent|routine)\">(STAT|Emergent|Urgent|Routine)</SelectItem>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": { "count": 4 } },
        { "type": "grep", "ignoreCase": true, "fixed": true, "pattern": "<option value=\"stat\"", "paths": ["frontend/src/pages/ReferralsNewPage.tsx"], "expect": "absent" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-06",
      "claim": "Status values (column and filter) are Pending, Processing, Ready for Review, Approved, Auto Created, Rejected, and Failed.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"(pending|processing|approved|auto_created|rejected|failed)\">(Pending|Processing|Approved|Auto Created|Rejected|Failed)</SelectItem>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": { "count": 6 } },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"ready_for_review\">", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "{item.queue_status.replace(\"_\", \" \")}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "absent", "note": "the Status column must print the same words as the filter" }
      ],
      "finding": "The filter uses these labels, but the Status column prints the raw value with only the first underscore replaced (frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx:713, String.replace with a string pattern). Rows read \"pending\", \"auto created\", and \"ready for_review\" — a display defect.",
      "proposed_text": "Use the Status filter to narrow the list: Pending, Processing, Ready for Review, Approved, Auto Created, Rejected, or Failed. (Fix the Status column first or describe it as showing the stored status in lower case.)",
      "proposed_checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"(pending|processing|approved|auto_created|rejected|failed)\">(Pending|Processing|Approved|Auto Created|Rejected|Failed)</SelectItem>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": { "count": 6 } },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"ready_for_review\">", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-07",
      "claim": "Confidence shows how confident extraction was for this fax.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "?.overall_confidence_score || 0", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-08",
      "claim": "SLA: an SLA indicator for the row; an \"SLA Breached\" summary also appears at the top of the queue.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "{item.sla_breached ? (", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<p className=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">SLA Breached</p>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-09",
      "claim": "Use the status, priority, and review filters to narrow the list.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"all\">All Statuses</SelectItem>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"all\">All Priorities</SelectItem>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<SelectItem value=\"requires_review\">", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-10",
      "claim": "Click a row to open the fax.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "<TableRow[^>]*onClick", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ],
      "finding": "Rows have a pointer cursor but no click handler (frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx:657-660). The fax opens from the View button in the Actions column (:740-755, handleViewDetails at :343). View is disabled while the row is Processing.",
      "proposed_text": "Click View in the row's Actions column to open the fax. (View is unavailable while the fax is Processing.)",
      "proposed_checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "onClick={() => handleViewDetails(item.id)}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "disabled={item.queue_status === \"processing\"}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-11",
      "claim": "The document is on one side; the extracted fields are on the other.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-6\">", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "{/* Right Column: Extracted Data Form", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<iframe", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-12",
      "claim": "Edit anything that is wrong, then Save Changes if you are not ready to create the patient yet.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "onClick={handleSave}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "^ +Save Changes$", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-13",
      "claim": "Approve & Create Patient creates the patient and a referral in New Referrals, the same outcome as Create Patient on the manual form.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": ": \"Approve & Create Patient\"}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "const result = await createPatientFromFax(", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "      status: \"NEW\",", "paths": ["frontend/src/services/idpService.ts"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "const referralRecordsResult = await createReferralRecordsForPatient(", "paths": ["frontend/src/services/idpService.ts"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-14",
      "claim": "If the fax should not become a patient, click Reject.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "onClick={handleReject}", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "^ +Reject$", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-15",
      "claim": "You can check Send digital consent form via SMS upon approval on the fax review screen when a phone number is available.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "<span>Send digital consent form via SMS upon approval</span>", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" },
        { "type": "grep", "fixed": true, "pattern": "editedData?.demographics?.phone ||", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx"], "expect": "present" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ri-fq-16",
      "claim": "There is no Convert to Referral, Mark Duplicate, or Open Referral button on this page, and no separate \"Create patient\" chip after insurance is verified.",
      "checks": [
        { "type": "grep", "pattern": "Convert to Referral|Mark Duplicate|Open Referral|>Create patient<", "paths": ["frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewDetail.tsx", "frontend/src/components/idp/FaxReviewQueue.tsx"], "expect": "absent" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
